# ---- data/: everything a run makes or extracts stays local. It holds the game's quest text, NPC names and casting,
# audio cut from the client, renders, and the voices designed for this realm's NPCs -- none of it is published here.
# Each file is described in README.md (what makes it, from what). examples/ holds a small sample of the formats.
# Tracked: the rules and settings the pipeline reads.
data/*
